yleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:45.00,Title,,0,0,250,,To Russian, With LoveDialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, you insolent little...Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think they were a little too disadvantaged?Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:56.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Disadvantaged?Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:02:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, now... do you really think this is meant to be a fair duel or something?Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an execution, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I think you have that backwards.Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander-san, you no longer need to look over your shoulder.Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:21.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I'm in your debt.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just about to be overwhelmed...Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,with rage!Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:35.05,Captions,,0,0,330,,Palace Plateau Third StepDialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We're just carrying away the corpse of the fallen!  Please let us go!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not dead yet!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,And it might take days before he wakes up again, but we want to look after him!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!  Have a warrior's mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:08.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine!  Just go already!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez...Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:20.07,Captions,,0,0,170,,The Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.49,Main,,0,0,1,,Oh, Senor!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It got through!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-sama, this is the factory team!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:29.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on with Princess Mansherry and Leo's group?Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The princess might be going through a horrible ordeal as we speak!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I just found out something terrible.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:41.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Something terrible?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment. I'll call Leo now, so stay on the line.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:48.95,Captions,,0,0,320,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:49.56,Main,,0,0,660,,Leo, can you hear me?Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Viola-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on our way up the rampart tower now!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the chapel in the palace soon!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, you have to hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Giolla is holding Mansherry, and is forcing her to use her ability!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:07.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?  That's awful!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.82,Main,,0,0,1,,Oh no!  Hurry up, Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:14.04,Captions,,0,0,170,,The Rampart Tower Underneath the Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.70,Main,,0,0,1,,There they are!  Dwarfs!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.02,Main,,0,0,1,,They're coming up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:15.73,Main,,0,0,1,,Fire, fire!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:17.67,Captions,,0,0,170,,The Stairway to the Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:21.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring the bombs!  I'll blow them away along with the stairway!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get there in a super hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang on a little bit more, Princess Mansherry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen to me already...Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.60,Captions,,0,900,590,,Behind the Chapel, First Floor  The Punishment RoomDialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.59,Main,,0,0,0,,princess of the Dwarfs!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:47.95,Main,,0,0,1,,I can't do it anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:51.02,Captions,,0,0,240,,The Tontatta Chief's Daughter and Princess of the Tontattans MansherryDialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go back to Green Bit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't help you anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:04:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:02.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did you call Boa Hancock?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:07.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I never... said anything like...Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a baby!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to unleash your ability!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the fallen commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The people who fought against our commanders, however...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,They may have been victorious, but they were gravely injured in their fights.Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If you resuscitate the commanders with your Healing Fruit power,Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,our foes will be powerless, and have to accept their own deaths!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle will be completely turned in our favor!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Now,Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,use the ability that recovered Sugar earlier again!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:02.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Take out the watering can filled with magic water!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Now!  Now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I've learned...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,that you're bad people who caused trouble for King Riku...Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and that King Doflamingo is lying to us.Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:30.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?!  Stop acting so high and mighty, you brazen Tontattan!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to cure bad people anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.19,Main,,0,0,0,,So adorable!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Adorable!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay focused!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did you call the once-in-a-millennium beauty?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.49,0:07:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then...Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I take it you don't care what happens to your friends at the factory?Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,B-But if I heal their wounds, they'll just hurt somebody again, won't they?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You cheeky little brat!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to squeeze the power out of you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me, Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:32.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I hit one!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Kabu-san!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Kabu-san?!  Leo!  What happened to him?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you soon!  I'm okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts!  You're hurting me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,His injuries were healed!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I see, princess of the Dwarfs.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:36.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you can heal wounds with your tears, too.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Cry some more!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:47.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!  Shed more healing tears!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:51.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It hurts!  Help!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Right away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Viola?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:05.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Giolla noticed Mansherry's tears can heal wounds!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,She's beating her cruelly to make her shed tears!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I, Mousey, will come save you now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:22.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use!  We have to count on Leo and Kabu-san for now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:26.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The princess of the Tontattas has the power to heal?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,She ate the Healing Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:35.47,Main,,0,0,0,,The basis of its power is healing wounds of living things.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No wonder the enemy wants it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to use that power to bring the fallen commanders back to full strength!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If they do, we're done for!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This is super bad!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, we're counting on you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Kabu-san, hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:59.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But Sugar isn't with them, right?Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,She is!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:19.01,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming back?!  You've got to be kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!  Take back the princess!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There it is! The punishment room!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I found her!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too late!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Get him!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:59.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, come back, commanders of the Donquixote Family!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Round Two, begins!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You take care of Giolla!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Beetle...Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Uppercut!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:33.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:43.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew...Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew, sew, sew, sew, sew!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll line them up and try again!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew, sew...Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll sew you all up together so you'll never get separated!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:20.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Haute Couture!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.89,Note,,0,0,0,,High Class SewingDialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Patchwork!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo came to save me...Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.59,Main,,0,0,0,,He's like a prince!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It... is... art...Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.64,Captions,,900,0,310,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,He made it!  That was really close!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:18.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He finished off Giolla before she could restore anyone!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Small person, a job well done!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Mansherry has been saved!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:36.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, I was scared...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess, you gained some weight again.Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:49.07,Main,,0,0,230,,The Tontattan Princess, Mansherry Rescued successfullyDialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Same old...Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo!  Leo!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I hurt my leg.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You can carry me on your back if you want!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Or you can carry me in your arms, that works too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,There it is!  The Princess' selfishness!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If you really were hurt, you could heal yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always been a good runner, so let's just run and get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'm not going anywhere.Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!  There it is!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:28.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The Princess' entitlement! Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:30.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like I want your help anyway. Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that attitude?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I really will leave you here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:38.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Just carry her on your back already!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly! You're selfish, entitled, and quick-tempered... Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're such a bother, Princess! Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo's back... Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,She's nice to everyone besides him.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How dense are you, Leo?Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awful!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:15.15,Main,,0,0,0,,They stole Mansherry away!  Catch those Dwarfs!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They went that way!  Don't let them get away! Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I... I failed...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is a crisis!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to report this to the young master!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Mansherry's ultimate ability is essential to the young master's plan.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Her ability to restore things in exchange for shortening her life!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if something happens to the Smile factory,Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,as long as we have the Healing Fruit power on our side,Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,we can restore it.  I'm sure that's what he's thinking!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:58.36,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, th-th...Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.69,Captions,,0,0,230,,The SMILE FactoryDialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:04.36,Captions,,0,0,330,,Franky vs. Senor PinkDialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.96,Main,,0,0,1,,The factory will be destroyed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.95,Main,,0,0,1,,Senor, defend the factory at all costs!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No!  Dodge, Senor!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Strong...Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hammer!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh!  He dove into the ground again!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:26.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland, he's gonna do it again!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Dodge!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:32.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Meow-Meow...Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Suplex!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh!  Senor!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither of them can keep this up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:16:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you could have dodged that attack, Fraland! Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:08.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You've taken that same attack thirty times in a row now!  Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Tontattans.Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Senor took the same punch thirty times too.Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,When somebody offers you a drink at a bar,Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,if you're a real man, you don't pull your glass away! Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!  Then, don't tell me you were...Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,This guy is one staunch dude.  So I...Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,will not try to avoid a single attack he throws at me.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take all of his attacks head-on, and still win at the end!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my... Strong-style!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my... Strong-style!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you're worried, but this is a manly duel!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll win no matter what, so just you watch!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you guys become their slaves again!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You make me drunker than some cheap bar, kid.Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget what you just said!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,not exactly young anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me end it with this next move.Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Senor, can I say one thing before that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're far away!  Way too far away!Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:37.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm getting at, right?Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you'd take all my attacks head-on.Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to live up to your manly declaration, then take this and...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,try staying alive!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,If, against all odds, you manage to get back up afterwards, I've lost.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take your final attack head-on!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.83,Main,,0,0,0,,He's swimming through the wall of the tower!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he up to?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the sky isn't particularly friendly today. Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, if I kept going up,Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:32.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be able to see Russian.Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian?Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I have a son named Gimlet, too.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, gravity persists.  I can't keep going up.Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!  What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Cyborg, your back is flesh and blood, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You... figured that out?! Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, stop talking!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Or you'll bite your own tongue off!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Meow-Meow Suplex!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby...Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Buster!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:45.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You gave me your word... Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,so it's my turn now!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I've lost.Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, young master.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Boxing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian...Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:23.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The day that I met you... and the day that you stopped smiling...Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,They were both nights of pouring rain like this...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The rain came out of nowhere, didn't it?  I'm soaked!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You're soaking wet, but you're smiling?Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:52.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I... like rain.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Things that I don't like?  Hmm...Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, pirates!  I hate them to death!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you do for a living?  C'mon, tell me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I work at a bank.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:12.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Really...Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.51,0:22:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Darling!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, Darling, what should we name him? Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Gimlet.Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a great name!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.49,0:23:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Gimlet died?Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:15.34,Main,,0,0,0,,A week ago today, the day you left without notice, Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,his temperature went up suddenly...Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,and I took him to the hospital, but there was nothing they could do!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:25.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar...Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:25.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I called the bank several times!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.47,0:23:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And they said they didn't have anyone like you working for them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!  Tell me the truth!Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you really do for a living?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of money are we living on?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:45.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!  Can't you answer?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.94,0:23:48.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not worthy to be a father anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.89,0:23:56.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Russian!  It's still stormy outside!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:23:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you take me for a fool?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me! Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.61,0:24:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think, Russian...Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.54,0:24:08.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The reason I can't tell you everything is...Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:10.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.73,0:24:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.03,0:24:21.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Because of the rain,Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.44,0:24:26.91,Main,,0,0,0,,there was a mudslide right above your wife, and she was caught in it.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Her condition is quite serious.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.37,0:24:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,In a vegetative state?Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is unconscious.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but the way things are now,Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.41,0:24:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,she'll probably never be able to express her feelings again.Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.61,0:24:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long her body can last, either...Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:50.05,Main,,0,0,0,,If only you hadn't met me, you would've...Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.05,0:24:52.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Darling!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!  I didn't wanna lose you...Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,So I lied!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to hear her respond... Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.26,0:25:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to hear her voice...Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.07,0:25:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,One more time... Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.65,0:25:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Just one more time...Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:18.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I want her to smile.Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,One more time...Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.98,0:25:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian, look.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.40,0:25:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I found the same bonnet that Gimlet used to wear!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.03,0:25:31.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, do I look like him?Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,He took after me, and all.Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.20,0:25:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!  I went too far with that joke.Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If someone sees me wearing this...Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.37,0:25:51.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian.Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.79,0:26:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You're one hell of a character, old man!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He lost his son, and his wife was in a terrible accident.Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough to break anyone.Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.70,0:26:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Pink, what the hell happened to your fashion sense?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:43.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.33,0:26:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!  It's a pervert!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.37,0:26:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Pervert passing through! Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.01,0:26:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh!  It's a freak!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.48,0:26:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!  Stop that!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.86,0:27:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Russian...Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.22,0:27:18.41,Main,,0,0,0,,To me,Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,these outfits are more valuable than the finest suits money can buy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.57,0:27:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the times I wear these outfits...Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,are the only times you smile for me.Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.48,0:28:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Senor!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Fraland!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.23,0:28:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:31.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Just what could you be recalling... Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.43,0:28:34.23,Main,,0,0,0,,that made you cry like that?Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.23,0:28:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother.Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.48,0:28:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If we meet again someday, somewhere...Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.05,0:28:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink,Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:02.83,Main,,0,0,0,,and then you can tell me...Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:08.18,Main,,0,0,0,,about that woman, Russian.Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.03,0:29:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle at the Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Winner: FrankyDialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:16.50,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Galaxy 9000, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis